File Index

/.gitignore
Purpose: This file specifies patterns for files and directories that Git should ignore.

/CLAUDE.md
Purpose: This file defines repository-wide coding standards, dependency management, and Docker practices for consistent, secure, and maintainable code generation.

/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
Purpose: Establishes community standards and enforcement guidelines for respectful participation in the ShatteredArchive project.

/CONTRIBUTING.md
Purpose: This file outlines contribution guidelines, branching strategy, and licensing for the Shattered Archive project.

/DISCLAIMER.md
Purpose: This file disclaims affiliation with referenced games and limits liability for software use.

/LICENSE
Purpose: This file establishes the licensing terms for the ShatteredArchive MUD Client, permitting non-commercial use, modification, and redistribution while prohibiting monetization of the software or its derivatives.

/LICENSE-COMMERCIAL
Purpose: This file outlines the terms for commercial use and licensing of ShatteredArchive software.

/LICENSING.md
Purpose: This file outlines the source available licensing model for ShatteredArchive software, permitting free use under specific conditions while restricting commercial monetization without explicit permission.

/PRIVACY.md
Purpose: This file outlines how user data is collected, stored, and protected by the ShatteredArchive software.

/README.md
Purpose: This repository provides a monorepo codebase for a MUD tooling ecosystem including client, server, and shared packages.

/SECURITY.md
Purpose: This file establishes the security vulnerability reporting policy and disclosure process for the ShatteredArchive software project.

/SUPPORT.md
Purpose: Provides guidelines for reporting bugs, security issues, and seeking support for the ShatteredArchive project.

/ShatteredArchive.code-workspace
Purpose: This file defines a multi-folder workspace configuration for the ShatteredArchive project and its related modules.

/eslint.config.mjs
Purpose: Configures ESLint rules and settings for a TypeScript/JavaScript codebase with client and server distinctions.

/jest.config.cjs
Purpose: Configures Jest test runner for both server and client-side TypeScript tests with separate environments and coverage settings.

/package.json
Purpose: This file manages project scripts, dependencies, and configuration for a monorepo development environment.

/pnpm-workspace.yaml
Purpose: Defines workspace packages and build dependencies for a monorepo project.

/shatteredarchive-ai.code-workspace
Purpose: This file defines a multi-folder workspace configuration for the Shattered Archive AI project.

/shatteredarchive-mobile.code-workspace
Purpose: This file configures the Visual Studio Code workspace settings and folder structure for the shatteredarchive-mobile project.

/tsconfig.base.json
Purpose: Shared TypeScript compiler configuration for consistent project-wide settings.

/tsconfig.jest.client.json
Purpose: Configures TypeScript compiler options for Jest client-side testing with custom path mappings.

/tsconfig.jest.json
Purpose: Configures TypeScript compiler options for Jest test environment.

/tsconfig.jest.server.json
Purpose: Configures TypeScript compiler options for Jest server-side tests with NodeNext module resolution.

/tsconfig.json
Purpose: This file configures TypeScript's compilation process by specifying which projects to include as references.
